{"pageid":5142,"title":"Oakwing 172 Airplane","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Oakwing 172 Airplane</span>","revid":21774,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Oakwing 172 Airplane</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9c/Plane_1.png/revision/latest?cb=20260602152700\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Plane 1\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9c/Plane_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20260602152700\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9c/Plane_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20260602152700 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9c/Plane_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20260602152700 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Plane 1\" width=\"270\" height=\"167\" data-image-key=\"Plane_1.png\" data-image-name=\"Plane 1.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Building\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Building</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alan's AutoLogistics</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">150,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Speed\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Speed</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">220</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><i>\"This beast of airplane can travel the skies like a breeze! It comes with two seats, cruise control, and more\"</i>\n</p><p>The <b>Oakwing 172</b> is an airplane that can be purchased from <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_Auto\" title=\"Alan&#39;s Auto\">Alan's Auto</a> for $150,000. This is one of the first flying vehicles added to the game, second one being Oak-900 Helicopter. Both can alternatively be obtained by buying a Flight Bundle for 399 Robux via the terminal next to the central display case\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>When driven, oakwing can achieve top speed of ~220 <small><code>studs/second</code></small> and ~70 <small><code>studs/second</code></small> in freefall state\n</p><p>Oakwing is a white aircraft with randomly choosen color patterns. Likely, oakwing has many rare variations like other vehicles does. Alternatively, you can choose on of basic aircraft's color <code>(249 robux)</code> and text on License plate <code>(79 robux)</code> in spawner's modification tab\n</p><p>Oakwing can haul and anchor objects in it's cabine, which is usefull for quickly transporting small shipments from shops\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Upgrades\">Upgrades</span></h2>\n<h4><span id=\"Airplane_Banner_Upgrade.2C_.2412.2C000\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Airplane_Banner_Upgrade,_$12,000\">Airplane Banner Upgrade, $12,000</span></h4>\n<p>It's a yellow toolbox which can be used on <b>Oakwing 172's</b> spawner to upgrade it. Upgrading it will attach customizable banner to your plane\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 306px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9c/Plane_1.png/revision/latest?cb=20260602152700\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Oakwing 172\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9c/Plane_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/306?cb=20260602152700\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"306\" height=\"189\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Plane 1.png\" data-image-key=\"Plane_1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Plane_1.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Oakwing 172</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 303px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f4/Flight_Bundle_Stand.png/revision/latest?cb=20260602152832\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Flight Bundle Stand\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f4/Flight_Bundle_Stand.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/303?cb=20260602152832\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"303\" height=\"214\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Flight Bundle Stand.png\" data-image-key=\"Flight_Bundle_Stand.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Flight_Bundle_Stand.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Flight Bundle Stand</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901121030\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 61/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 58/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019512/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   24.384      1 Template:Vehicles\n100.00%   24.384      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:5142-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901121030 and revision id 21774. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Alan's Auto","exists":true}],"images":["Plane_1.png","Flight_Bundle_Stand.png"]}
